WEBVTT - Made with VTT Creator

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000 position:50% align:middle
Clicking on the cipher wheel to view it.

00:03.395 --> 00:05.395 position:50% align:middle
Pointing at the encoding for "fr" to draw attention to it.

00:05.907 --> 00:07.907 position:50% align:middle
Closing the cipher wheel.

00:07.151 --> 00:09.151 position:50% align:middle
Clicking on lamps to turn them on/off to encode "fr".

00:13.627 --> 00:16.627 position:50% align:middle
Hovering the mouse over the grandfather clock to "ring the bell" and submit the encoding from the lamps.

00:17.076 --> 00:19.076 position:50% align:middle
Repeating the process for "ie".

00:19.506 --> 00:21.506 position:50% align:middle
Repeating the process for "nd".

00:22.012 --> 00:24.012 position:50% align:middle
Repeating the process for "sh".

00:24.103 --> 00:26.103 position:50% align:middle
Repeating the process for "nd"

00:28.694 --> 00:30.694 position:50% align:middle
A pop-up reveals the code "FR13ND5H1P" which spells "Friendship" in leet speak.

